# One folder per run of the app: the script, its log and its output/ (see README.md)
runs/
recordings/
__pycache__/
# The Plotly package's plotly.js, which common/network3d.py writes for the 3-D window
components/network3d/plotly.min.js
# The app's own files, which the repository's .gitignore (output*, *.png) would leave out
!common/output_panel.py
!assets/*.png
